WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
My people! Today na history!

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
I don become Papa — officially!

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.200
Felix, abeg — na me carry am six months.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Na election wey I win! Landslide!

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Mama, we get news… Ada dey pregnant! Six
months!

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.800
Six months? And na today una dey tell me?

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Mama, we wan make sure say everything dey
okay first…

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.800
Make sure of wetin? Say na Felix get am?

9
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Mama! Ah-ah! Wetin be this?!

10
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.000
Woman wey just come, marry my only son —
now belle don show.

11
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.800
For this Lagos, person must ask.

12
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.500
Mama, I respect you. This baby na your
grandchild.

13
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.600
We go see. DNA go talk.

14
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.500
Babe, she no mean am… Mama na comedian.

15
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.800
Felix, na only you be comedian for this
house.

16
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Meow… Mama brain dey suspect.

17
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.800
Nobody go insult my pikin.

18
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.800
Nobody. I swear. Even if na Mama.

19
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.500
Felix, carry my load. From today, I dey
stay here.

20
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.800
Na God send am come… make e dey watch.

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.500
Na so the wahala start.
